post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
==> Aqueous Settings for Noctalia v5 installed.

The plugin UI and aqueous-config helper are installed. Register the packaged
path source and enable the plugin as your desktop user:

  noctalia msg plugins source add aqueous path /usr/share/aqueous/noctalia-plugins
  noctalia msg plugins enable aqueous/settings

Then add "Aqueous Settings" from Noctalia's bar widget picker. The helper edits
the files in ~/.config/aqueous and applies supported changes to a running
Aqueous session through aqueousctl.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
    cat <<'EOF'
==> Aqueous Settings for Noctalia v5 upgraded.

Reload the packaged source as your desktop user, then reopen the panel:

  noctalia msg plugins update aqueous
EOF
}

post_remove() {
    cat <<'EOF'
==> Aqueous Settings for Noctalia v5 removed.

Noctalia's per-user source registration and plugin state were retained. Remove
the "aqueous" source from Noctalia manually if it is no longer wanted. Aqueous
configuration files were not removed.
EOF
}
